\par
{\f0\b\fs28 App Name\par}
{\f1\fs24 Writing Shed Pro\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs28 Subtitle (30 chars max)\par}
{\f1\fs24 The Complete Writing Studio\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs28 Description\par}
\par
{\f1\fs24 Writing Shed Pro is a powerful, all-in-one writing app for iPhone, iPad, and Mac \emdash  built for poets, novelists, playwrights, and prose writers who want professional tools without the complexity.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 ONE APP. EVERY GENRE.\par}
{\f1\fs24 Create projects tailored to your craft \emdash  Poetry, Fiction (novel or short fiction), Drama, Prose, or Manual. Each project type comes with smart templates, specialized tools, and an organized folder structure so you can focus on the words, not the filing.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 WRITE WITH CONFIDENCE\par}
{\f1\fs24 A rich text editor with bold, italic, underline, strikethrough, and a full stylesheet system lets you define and apply consistent styles across your entire project. Real-time word and line counts, inline comments, footnotes, hyperlinks, and image support give you everything you need \emdash  right where you need it.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 POETRY TOOLS THAT UNDERSTAND METER\par}
{\f1\fs24 Choose from dozens of established forms \emdash  Sonnet, Haiku, Villanelle, Tanka, and more \emdash  or create your own. A real-time syllable counter powered by the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary, stress pattern analysis, and a poetry metrics dashboard help you nail the rhythm every time.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 FICTION TOOLS THAT SHAPE YOUR STORY\par}
{\f1\fs24 Organize your novel into chapters and scenes. Build character profiles, location details, and plot outlines. Choose from Freeform, Three-Act, or Monomyth story structures. Move scenes between chapters as your story evolves.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 DRAMA TOOLS FOR STAGE AND SCREEN\par}
{\f1\fs24 Write screenplays and stage plays using Drama Markup Language \emdash  a lightweight, readable syntax that automatically formats character names, dialogue, and stage directions. The same source renders correctly as either film/screenplay or stage play format.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 SEE IT ON THE PAGE\par}
{\f1\fs24 A true WYSIWYG paginated preview shows exactly how your document will look when printed. Configure paper size, margins, headers, footers, and page numbers for each project independently.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 ASSEMBLE YOUR MANUSCRIPT\par}
{\f1\fs24 Compile your entire project \emdash  front matter, body, and back matter \emdash  into a single formatted manuscript. Auto-generated table of contents, index, glossary, citations, bibliography, and table of figures are built in.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 TRACK SUBMISSIONS & PUBLICATIONS\par}
{\f1\fs24 Keep a record of where you\'92ve sent your work, when, and what happened. Manage publication venues, group files into submission packets, and never lose track of a response again.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 IMPORT & EXPORT YOUR WORK\par}
{\f1\fs24 \bullet  Export your assembled manuscript as a professionally formatted PDF\par}
{\f1\fs24 \bullet  Export individual files as Word (.docx), RTF, HTML, or Markdown\par}
{\f1\fs24 \bullet  Import Word (.docx), RTF, and Markdown files into any project\par}
{\f1\fs24 \bullet  Import and export Fountain (.fountain) and Final Draft (.fdx) files for drama projects\par}
{\f1\fs24 \bullet  Share complete projects in the native .wsp format\par}
{\f1\fs24 \bullet  Migrate from the original Writing Shed app with smart database import\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 PRINT LIKE A PRO\par}
{\f1\fs24 Print single files, entire collections, or submission packets with professional formatting, footnotes, and page layout \emdash  on iPhone, iPad, or Mac.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 SYNCED ACROSS ALL YOUR DEVICES\par}
{\f1\fs24 Your projects, files, formatting, and metadata sync seamlessly via iCloud. Start a poem on your iPhone, revise it on your iPad, and print it from your Mac.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 LEARN AS YOU GO\par}
{\f1\fs24 A comprehensive built-in user guide with tutorials walks you through everything from getting started to assembling a professional manuscript. Smart contextual tips appear at just the right moment to help you discover features \emdash  from your first project through advanced workflows. All tips are dismissible and can be reset at any time.\par}
\par
{\f0\b\fs24 TRY IT FREE\par}
{\f1\fs24 Explore every project type at no cost \emdash  with limited use (one project and one file per type). When you\'92re ready, unlock full capabilities by genre \emdash  Prose Writer, Poetry Writer, Fiction Writer, Drama Writer \emdash  or get everything with the All-in Bundle.\par}
